# Environment Variables Documentation

This file documents the variables used across the application. Copy `.env.example` to `.env` if setting up a fresh clone.

| Variable | Required | Description | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF` | Yes | Supabase Project Reference ID | `mjoymdurdhwiuolzfwoy` |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` | Yes | Supabase REST / GraphQL API URL | `https://mjoymdurdhwiuolzfwoy.supabase.co` |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Recommended | Supabase Anonymous / Public API Key (from Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API) | `eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...` |
| `VITE_ENABLE_MOCK_FALLBACK` | No | Auto-fallback to local state when Supabase connection is offline | `true` |
| `VITE_SKIP_PAYMENT_GATE` | No | Bypasses commercial payment gates for free assessment MVP | `true` |
